# Tests

Use Pest feature tests against the database. Mock the WeCom client; do not use `Http::allowStrayRequests()` or real tokens.

Each phase's tests stay in the suite. A later feature is not done if earlier tests fail.

Cover at least: first sync, second sync without duplicates, department move, status 5 cannot log in, failed payload does not mass-disable users, local admin survives sync, unknown userid does not create a user.
